s, and total. The table also shows a summary for only criminal and civil cases. The metrics are calculated as the number of incoming cases to the Supreme Court divided by the number of determined cases in courts of appeal during the same time period."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Andel mål i procent som överklagats från hovrätt till Högsta domstolen, uppdelat i brottmål, tvistemål samt totalt. Även en summering för enbart brott- och tvistemål visas. Måtten beräknas som antal inkomna mål till Högsta domstolen dividerat med antal avgjorda mål på hovrätt under samma tidsperiod."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-06-02"},"dct:language":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"}],"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-31T09:30:00"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021002742"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"http://sws.geonames.org/2661886"},"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:5dbaecab085988aa13bacd47b077218af64edc05a87315e7b4a4d885b357c35b_b0n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Frequency of appeal from courts of appeal to the Supreme Court"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Överklagandefrekvens hovrätt till Högsta domstolen"}],"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.domstol.se/om-sveriges-domstolar/statistik-styrning-och-utveckling/statistik/officiell-domstolsstatistik/"}},{"@id":"http://pxweb.etjanst.domstol.se/distribution/en/04_Overklagandefrekvens_HR_till_HD.px","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"http://pxweb.etjanst.domstol.se/PxWeb/api/v1/en/DOMstat/Overklagande/04_Overklagandefrekvens_HR_till_HD.px"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"en","@value":"Metadata (en)"},"http://dat