rnment. The time is measured at the 75th percentile for cases determined during the selected time period (time from filed case to determined case)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Handläggningstid i månader för alla kammarrätter och per kammarrätt för den verksamhetsmålskategori som regeringen satt en målsättning för. Tiden mäts i 75:e percentilen för mål som avgjorts under aktuell tidsperiod från inkommandedag till avgjortdag."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-06-02"},"dct:language":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"}],"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-31T09:30:00"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021002742"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"http://sws.geonames.org/2661886"},"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:bf12f2df5af19fe1d1473cf0530f725facff10600d3e7236e20d750dcb6ae205_b0n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Performance of the time targets at administrative courts of appeal (excluding migration, turnaround time 75 percentile in months)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Verksamhetsmål vid kammarrätt exkl migration (handläggningstid 75-percentil i månader)"}],"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.domstol.se/om-sveriges-domstolar/statistik-styrning-och-utveckling/statistik/officiell-domstolsstatistik/"}},{"@id":"http://pxweb.etjanst.domstol.se/distribution/en/05_Verksamhetsmal_KR.px","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"http://pxweb.etjanst.domstol.se/PxWeb/api/v1/en/DOMstat/Verksamhetsmal/05_Verksamhetsmal_KR.px"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"en","@value":"Metadata (en)"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availabilit